    "id": "_14126305_1",
    "title": "Cronograma",
    "body": "<div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.65; color: #222;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #2b2b2b;\">Cronograma</h2><div style=\"height: 3px; width: 56px; background-color: #6c8cff; border-radius: 99px; margin-top: 12px;\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px;\">O cronograma abaixo pode sofrer ajustes conforme o andamento da turma e necessidades pedagógicas.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; background-color: #fff4d6; border: 1px solid #f3d28b; border-radius: 3px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\"></div>Atividades de Seminário / Entregas de Projeto. <br><div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; background-color: #ffeef0; border: 1px solid #f5b7b1; border-radius: 3px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px; margin-top: 5px;\"></div>Avaliações, Questionários e Apresentações Finais.</div><div style=\"border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #ececf1;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\"><thead><tr style=\"background-color: #f4f6fa;\"><th style=\"padding: 14px; width: 5.96026%; text-align: left;\">#</th><th style=\"padding: 14px; width: 15.9886%; text-align: left;\">Data</th><th style=\"padding: 14px; width: 77.9565%; text-align: left;\">Conteúdo Previsto</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">1</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">04/03</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Introdução à Inteligência Artificial</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9fbff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">2</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">11/03</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Desenvolvimento Ético para IA</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">3</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">18/03</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Revisão Python para IA</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9fbff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">4</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">25/03</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Revisão Python para IA</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">5</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">01/04</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Revisão Python para IA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">6</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">08/04</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\"><strong>Computação Bioinspirada</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">7</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">15/04</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\"><strong>Agente Inteligente e Sistema MultiAgente</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff4d6;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">8</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">22/04</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\"><strong>Apresentação Seminário Bioinspirado</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">9</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">29/04</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Machine Learning</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9fbff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">10</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">06/05</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Redes Neurais</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">11</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">13/05</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\"><em>Conecta: Semana Acadêmica</em></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9fbff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">12</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">20/05</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Visão Computacional</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">13</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">27/05</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Visão Computacional</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9fbff;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">14</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">03/06</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Processamento de Linguagem Natural</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff4d6;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">15</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">10/06</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Projeto Final I (Início)</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff4d6;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">16</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">17/06</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Projeto Final I (Desenvolvimento)</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff4d6;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">17</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">24/06</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Projeto Final I (Desenvolvimento) - Assíncrono</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">18</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">01/07</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\">Chatbots e PLN</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.96026%;\">19</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 15.9886%;\">08/07</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 77.9565%;\"><strong>Apresentações Finais?</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #ffeef0;\"><td style=\"padding: 12px; width: 5.9